# Phase 6 — Monitoring & Logging

## Overview

The Data Warehouse private cloud is monitored using a lightweight observability
stack deployed on the K3s cluster.

The monitoring architecture consists of:

- Prometheus
- Grafana
- Node Exporter
- PostgreSQL Exporter
- Loki
- Grafana Alloy
- Grafana Alerting
- Kubernetes Metrics Server

