2. Prometheus

Prometheus collects time-series metrics from the infrastructure and
PostgreSQL exporter.

Configuration:

Scrape interval: 15 seconds
Retention: 3 days
Deployment replicas: 1

Prometheus monitors:

Node CPU
Node memory
Node filesystem
Network traffic
PostgreSQL health
PostgreSQL database statistics
3. Node Exporter

Node Exporter runs as a DaemonSet.

One exporter runs on each K3s node.

Metrics include:

CPU utilization
Memory utilization
Available memory
Filesystem usage
Network receive traffic
Network transmit traffic
4. PostgreSQL Exporter

PostgreSQL Exporter provides database-level metrics.

Database:

DataWarehouse

The exporter exposes metrics on port:

9187

Database availability is monitored using:

pg_up

Expected healthy value:

pg_up = 1
5. Grafana

Grafana provides the monitoring dashboard.

Dashboard:

