PostgreSQL active connections
PostgreSQL tuples fetched
PostgreSQL tuples inserted
6. Logging

Centralized logging is implemented using:

Grafana Alloy
Loki
Grafana Explore

Alloy runs as a DaemonSet on the K3s nodes and collects Kubernetes container
logs.

Logs are forwarded to Loki.

Example LogQL queries:

{namespace="datawarehouse"}

PostgreSQL logs:

{namespace="datawarehouse", container="postgres"}

Kubernetes system logs:

{namespace="kube-system"}
