8. Resource-Conscious Design

The monitoring stack was designed for a resource-constrained private cloud.

Resource limits were applied to monitoring components to prevent observability
services from consuming excessive cluster resources.

Prometheus and Grafana were configured with lightweight resource limits and
short metric retention.

Loki uses 24-hour log retention for the initial deployment.

